# This committed local-development configuration contains no secrets. It earns its keep twice:
# it sets a local ENVIRONMENT, and because Wrangler ignores `.env` for the Worker's `env` object
# once `.dev.vars` exists, it also keeps the deployment token (CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN) out of
# `env` — a Worker must never be able to read the account's own API token.
ENVIRONMENT=development
